BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (deliberately implement a narrow workflow: approved positive-value invoices, full settlement, paid operating expenses,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (and one currency per database. Initialize the database once before starting workers; each worker then opens its own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (connection on a local disk with reliable locking. Do not deploy this file on an object store or an unsuitable network) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (filesystem. The single writer acquires BEGIN IMMEDIATE before reading mutable state, and every state change,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (journal entry, and idempotency result commits together. Concurrent replay therefore cannot double-recognize a case) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (through these functions. A busy timeout fails the request without acknowledging success; the caller retries the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (event identifier and identical payload. The unique partner/external identifier also stops a duplicate intake disguised with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (another event identifier. Authentication, authorization, signature validation, payload size limits, and secret storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (belong in the adapter before these functions. Treat their absence from this compact reference as integration work, not as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (permission to expose a database operation directly to an unauthenticated browser or partner callback.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (Intake scoring is an eligibility switch, not a speculative estimate of player value. The trusted adapter resolves rights,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (territory, registration scope, and operator eligibility from maintained evidence; user-supplied booleans cannot satisfy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (those checks. The immutable amount represents an approved commercial unit, such as a $200 accepted CPA, not the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (customer's deposit. Verification requires earned revenue evidence: delivered subscription service, an approved builder) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (statement, an accepted first-time-depositor qualification, or a finalized NGR waterfall. The requested) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (verification/escrow state machine is implemented as an evidence reserve only. Intake can become rejected or verified;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (verified can become released after a bank-backed match. No state holds customer funds, and released means the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (operator's invoice was collected. Prepaid annual subscriptions need deferred revenue and monthly service recognition,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (so they remain outside this monthly earned-service example. Similarly, refunds, partial payments, currency conversion,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (and later clawbacks require explicit compensating-entry extensions before those features are enabled. Never edit an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (earned amount to hide a dispute. Preserve the original record and add a separately authorized adjustment workflow with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (its own replay key, evidence, and balancing entries when extending the reference.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Every journal row specifies equal debit and credit cents, giving the reconciliation view a transparent bridge between) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (revenue, expense, receivables, and cash change. Integer cents avoid binary floating-point drift; rounding occurs once) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (when the contractual invoice is prepared. A settlement references a canonical bank receipt allocation, and its unique) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (key prevents that allocation from funding two cases. For a bulk remittance, the adapter must first construct immutable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (allocation lines whose sum equals the bank receipt; this reference accepts only those prevalidated full-invoice lines.) Tj ET
