BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (ledger. The supplied test exercises concurrent identical verification, altered replay rejection, settlement mismatch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (rollback, duplicate settlement suppression, and accounting totals. It is included as executable QA, not represented as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (having been run here. Before production, add process-crash recovery tests, duplicate receipt tests across separate cases,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (restoration drills, and authenticated adapter tests. All outward financial actions remain outside these modules: they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (record observed receipts and expenses rather than initiating transfers. That separation avoids pretending a database) Tj ET
